  "id": "xanax",
  "term": "Xanax",
  "definition": "Xanax is alprazolam, a triazolobenzodiazepine drug with anxiety-reducing, sedative-hypnotic, and anticonvulsant effects. It acts in the central nervous system by binding to a benzodiazepine site on the GABA-A receptor complex, which strengthens GABA’s inhibitory action and lowers neuronal excitability.",
